r of cfd.json and <case>.bin, from the page; tools/cfd/export.mjs), speed (km/h of the","-// readouts), cases [{ id, label, part: [x, y, z] (mm, marker), say (what the visitor sees change) }], start (case id).","-// Readouts and arrows show the mean change over both grids (cfd.json `est`); changes the tunnel could not separate from its","-// own noise (`settled`) read \"–\".","+// One part's airflow, computed ahead of time (tools/cfd/part.mjs; files: lib/model/part-field.js): a flat grid through the","+// part coloured by one quantity, the body's solid cells drawn opaque, mean-flow paths with arrowheads and air drifting","+// along them, and the guides that carry the lesson (an arrow for the mean direction in a fixed box, a line across the","+// wake or under an edge). Switching case keeps camera, scale, seeds and guides' places: only the air and the part change.","+// Params: label, data (folder of field.json and <case>.bin, from the page), cases [{ id, label, say (what the visitor sees","+// change) }], start (case id), follow (true: a \"Follow the air\" toggle that singles out the case's `follow` paths and","+// only then shows `say`). With one case there are no case buttons. \"Pause airflow\" stops the drift; the picture stays."," import * as THREE from \"three\";","-import { V, polyline, at, particles } from \"../lib/scene/helpers.js\";","+import { V, polyline, at, particles, place, rod } from \"../lib/scene/helpers.js\";","+import { corners, SOLID } from \"../lib/model/part-field.js\";"," ","-const NS = \"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", SEQ = \"--cfd-1 --cfd-2 --cfd-3 --cfd-4 --cfd-5\".split(\" \");","-const KG = 50 / 0.6;   // arrow scale: kg of load per metre of arrow (60 cm for 50 kg)","+const NS = \"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", DOTS = 6;"," "," export function create(ctx, p) {","-  const { stage, carRoot, t } = ctx, m = v => v / 1000;","-  const group = new THREE.Group(); carRoot.add(group);","-  const q = 0.5 * 1.2 * (p.speed / 3.6) ** 2;   // dynamic pres