ed box and cleaner paths. The base capture (`/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kunabel-workspace-MercedesExperience/5216a6b1-4da7-448e-be48-b0eb888aff5f/scratchpad/wing-base.png`) has not yet been viewed after the fix.\n\n   Background solves are still running (3-D coarse grids first; 2-D splitter 5 mm sequence and the two 2.5 mm runs).\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   - View the updated wing-base.png to confirm the baseline arrow tips down.\n   - Check solve progress with `tail -n 3 tools/cfd/out/logs/*.log`.\n   - As runs finish, export each part and write the result-based captions and Hungarian translations.\n   - This continues the user's request to \"Implement it. Update the dev view when done\". The dev-view reload in Chrome comes last, after the tests pass.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/kunabel/.claude/projects/-Users-kunabel-workspace-MercedesExperience/5216a6b1-4da7-448e-be48-b0eb888aff5f.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."},"isVisibleInTranscriptOnly":true,"isCompactSummary":true,"uuid":"b19efee8-17a0-42ec-a5c7-19f8dd225ac2","timestamp":"2026-11-25T21:19:37.433Z","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":1,"turnIndex":1},"turnPromptId":"520f657a-52b6-42e2-ac69-925bae4d884a","turnOrigin":"human","summarizedTurnPromptUuids":["0908883f-dc9e-4717-96da-532360e8adcd"],"session_id":"e01a3517-ccd0-4282-af04-8d07c795c5fc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kunabel