om the traced centre-plane profile (tools/cfd/part.mjs splitter); lip travel and thickness illustrative.\n        // Colour is speed: the 2-D tunnel's pressure level floats (see part.mjs), only differences across the lip are read.`);\nrep(`      talk: [\"SPLITTER_TALK\"],`,`      talk: [\n        \"Mercedes-Benz describes a front spoiler with two positions for the Evolution II. The lip's 4 cm of travel and 25 mm thickness here are illustrative.\",\n        \"The picture is a slice through the nose at the car's centre line, computed ahead of time in two dimensions, as if the nose were endlessly wide. Colour is the air's speed against the road speed; grey is the body and the lip. The road moves at the car's speed and carries the air under the car with it.\",\n        \"Pressure was sampled just above and just below where the lip's front end is, or would be. SPLIT_GRIDS\",\n        \"A 2-D section has no air escaping round the sides of the bumper, and its Reynolds number is about a thousandth of the real car's: read the direction of the change, not its size. No front-axle load is given.\",\n      ],`);\nfs.writeFileSync(f,s);\nEOF\ngrep -c \"SPLIT\\|ARCH_\\|WIDTH_\\|GRID_NOTE\" stops/190e-evo2/car.js stops/w196r/car.js","description":"Write splitter texts and tighten its camera"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":196450,"output_tokens":2796,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1456},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2796,"cache_read_input_tokens":196450,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365},"type":"message"}],"spe