{"parentUuid":"a2363774-9249-4b4a-a792-d4a97b5d3def","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"57eb6650-e673-4ad5-9fa8-0b57bf11f826","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UPCSiMH2hekfDfX56kK1Bz","type":"tool_result","content":"stops/190e-evo2/car.js:ARCH_GRIDS\nstops/190e-evo2/car.js:SPLIT_GRIDS\nstops/190e-evo2/hu.js:ARCH_GRIDS_HU\nstops/190e-evo2/hu.js:SPLIT_GRIDS_HU\nstops/w196r/car.js:GRID_NOTE\nstops/w196r/hu.js:GRID_NOTE_HU\n[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: stops/190e-evo2/car.js. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b7984aa0-5418-462e-8df1-f9263d4d4536","timestamp":"2026-11-25T22:48:47.451Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"stops/190e-evo2/car.js:ARCH_GRIDS\nstops/190e-evo2/car.js:SPLIT_GRIDS\nstops/190e-evo2/hu.js:ARCH_GRIDS_HU\nstops/190e-evo2/hu.js:SPLIT_GRIDS_HU\nstops/w196r/car.js:GRID_NOTE\nstops/w196r/hu.js:GRID_NOTE_HU","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"staleReadFileStateHint":"[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: stops/190e-evo2/car.js. Call Read before editing.]","bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience/stops/190e-evo2/car.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":81,"oldLines":7,"newStart":81,"newLines":7,"lines":["     {","       id: \"wheel-arch\", label: \"Front wheel arch\", subsystem: \"race-aero\",","       prompt: \"Seen from above at hub height: the bumper corner, the front tyre in its flared arch, the door behind. Tap Follow the air and trace one path from in front of the car.\",","-      answer: \"It starts 78 cm from the car's centre line, in line with the tyre, and the bumper corner turns it outward. It never comes back in: by the dashed line, 60 cm behind the axle, it runs about ARCH_SHIFT cm further out, well clear of the door. The flared arch is the widest point of the car, and along the flank behind it the air moves slower (green and blue) than in the fast stream outside (red).\",","+      answer: \"It starts 78 cm from the car's centre line, in line with the tyre, and the bumper corner turns it outward. It never comes back in: by the dashed line, 60 cm behind the axle, it runs about 38 cm further out, well clear of the door. The flared arch is the widest point of the car, and along the flank behind it the air moves slower (green and blue) than in the fast stream outside (red).\",","       more: \"Wind tunnel details\",","       view: { pos: [0, 1.3, 3.8], target: [0, 0.75, 0.344] },","       ghost: { fill: 0, edge: 0 },"]},{"oldStart":89,"oldLines":7,"newStart":89,"newLines":7,"lines":["         label: \"Front corner · seen from above at hub height\",","         data: \"stops/190e-evo2/cfd/wheel-arch/\", start: \"fitted\", follow: true,","         // Local 3-D run of the front corner (tools/cfd/part.mjs evo-arch, tools/cfd/corner.mjs).","-        cases: [{ id: \"fitted\", label: \"Flared arch\", say: \"This path starts in line with the tyre, just in front of the bumper corner. The corner and the flared arch push it about ARCH_SHIFT cm outward; it keeps that line past the door.\" }],","+        cases: [{ id: \"fitted\", label: \"Flared arch\", say: \"This path starts in line with the tyre, just in front of the bumper corner. The corner and the flared arch push it about 38 cm outward; it keeps that line past the door.\" }],","       },","       talk: [","         \"The Evolution II's arches were widened so that wider wheels and tyres would fit under the body, and shaped with the rest of the body kit in the wind tunnel.\","]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience/stops/190e-evo2/hu.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":50,"oldLines":11,"newStart":50,"newLines":11,"lines":["     {","       label: \"Első kerékív\",","       prompt: \"Felülről, kerékagy-magasságban: a lökhárító sarka, az első gumi a kiszélesített kerékívben, mögötte az ajtó. Koppintson a Kövesse a levegőt gombra, és kövessen végig egy útvonalat az autó elől.\",","-      answer: \"Az autó középvonalától 78 cm-re indul, a gumival egy vonalban, és a lökhárító sarka kifelé fordítja. Vissza már nem tér: a tengely mögött 60 cm-re húzott szaggatott vonalnál kb. ARCH_SHIFT cm-rel kijjebb halad, jócskán az ajtó mellett. A kiszélesített kerékív az autó legszélesebb pontja, és mögötte az oldalfal mentén a levegő lassabban mozog (zöld és kék), mint kint a gyors áramlásban (piros).\",","+      answer: \"Az autó középvonalától 78 cm-re indul, a gumival egy vonalban, és a lökhárító sarka kifelé fordítja. Vissza már nem tér: a tengely mögött 60 cm-re húzott szaggatott vonalnál kb. 38 cm-rel kijjebb halad, jócskán az ajtó mellett. A kiszélesített kerékív az autó legszélesebb pontja, és mögötte az oldalfal mentén a levegő lassabban mozog (zöld és kék), mint kint a gyors áramlásban (piros).\",","       more: \"A szélcsatorna részletei\",","       params: {","         label: \"Az első sarok · felülről, kerékagy-magasságban\",","-        cases: [{ label: \"Kiszélesített kerékív\", say: \"Ez az útvonal a gumival egy vonalban indul, közvetlenül a lökhárító sarka előtt. A sarok és a kiszélesített kerékív kb. ARCH_SHIFT cm-rel kifelé tolja, és ezt a vonalat az ajtó mellett is megtartja.\" }],","+        cases: [{ label: \"Kiszélesített kerékív\", say: \"Ez az útvonal a gumival egy vonalban indul, közvetlenül a lökhárító sarka előtt. A sarok és a kiszélesített kerékív kb. 38 cm-rel kifelé tolja, és ezt a vonalat az ajtó mellett is megtartja.\" }],","       },","       talk: [","         \"Az Evolution II kerékíveit azért szélesítették ki, hogy szélesebb kerekek és gumik férjenek a karosszéria alá, és a karosszériacsomag többi részével együtt formálták őket a szélcsatornában.\","]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience/stops/w196r/car.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":30,"oldLines":7,"newStart":30,"newLines":7,"lines":["     {","       id: \"wheel\", label: \"Front wheel\", subsystem: \"race-aero\",","       prompt: \"Seen from above at hub height: the front tyre, the body beside it and a dashed line across the air behind the wheel. Switch bodies: how much slow air (blue) crosses the line?\",","-      answer: \"Behind the bare tyre, a band of slow, churned air about WIDTH_EXP cm wide trails downstream. With the wheel enclosed, the slow air at the same line is only a layer about WIDTH_ENC cm thick on the body's skin. The wider body pushes more air aside, yet leaves far less churned air behind the wheel: the streamliner's advantage on the fast straights of Reims and Monza. In corners its drivers paid for it, unable to see the front wheels to place them.\",","+      answer: \"Behind the bare tyre, a band of slow, churned air about 23 cm wide trails downstream. With the wheel enclosed, the slow air at the same line is only a layer about 4 cm thick on the body's skin. The wider body pushes more air aside, yet leaves far less churned air behind the wheel: the streamliner's advantage on the fast straights of Reims and Monza. In corners its drivers paid for it, unable to see the front wheels to place them.\",","       more: \"Wind tunnel details\",","       view: { pos: [0.1, 1.3, 4.1], target: [0.1, 0.75, 0.344] },","       ghost: { fill: 0, edge: 0 },"]},{"oldStart":39,"oldLines":8,"newStart":39,"newLines":8,"lines":["         data: \"stops/w196r/cfd/wheel/\", start: \"enclosed\",","         // Local 3-D runs of the front corner (tools/cfd/part.mjs w196-wheel, tools/cfd/corner.mjs); body sizes assumed.","         cases: [","-          { id: \"enclosed\", label: \"Enclosed\", say: \"Enclosed: the tyre turns in its own wheelhouse and the air flows round the smooth body, faster beside it. At the orange mark the slow air is a layer about WIDTH_ENC cm thick on the skin.\" },","-          { id: \"exposed\", label: \"Exposed\", say: \"Exposed: the air meets the bare tyre and leaves a band of slow air about WIDTH_EXP cm wide behind it, a little wider than the tyre itself.\" },","+          { id: \"enclosed\", label: \"Enclosed\", say: \"Enclosed: the tyre turns in its own wheelhouse and the air flows round the smooth body, faster beside it. At the orange mark the slow air is a layer about 4 cm thick on the skin.\" },","+          { id: \"exposed\", label: \"Exposed\", say: \"Exposed: the air meets the bare tyre and leaves a band of slow air about 23 cm wide behind it, a little wider than the tyre itself.\" },","         ],","       },","       talk: ["]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience/stops/w196r/hu.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":10,"oldLines":13,"newStart":10,"newLines":13,"lines":["     {","       label: \"Első kerék\",","       prompt: \"Felülről, kerékagy-magasságban: az első gumi, mellette a karosszéria, és egy szaggatott vonal a kerék mögötti levegőn át. Váltson a karosszériák között: mennyi lassú (kék) levegő keresztezi a vonalat?\",","-      answer: \"A szabad gumi mögött kb. WIDTH_EXP cm széles sávban húzódik lassú, felkavart levegő. Burkolt kerékkel ugyanennél a vonalnál a lassú levegő csak egy kb. WIDTH_ENC cm vastag réteg a karosszéria bőrén. A szélesebb karosszéria több levegőt tol félre, mégis sokkal kevesebb felkavart levegőt hagy a kerék mögött: ez volt az áramvonalas előnye Reims és Monza gyors egyenesein. A kanyarokban a versenyzői megfizették az árát, mert nem látták az első kerekeket, hogy pontosan helyezzék őket.\",","+      answer: \"A szabad gumi mögött kb. 23 cm széles sávban húzódik lassú, felkavart levegő. Burkolt kerékkel ugyanennél a vonalnál a lassú levegő csak egy kb. 4 cm vastag réteg a karosszéria bőrén. A szélesebb karosszéria több levegőt tol félre, mégis sokkal kevesebb felkavart levegőt hagy a kerék mögött: ez volt az áramvonalas előnye Reims és Monza gyors egyenesein. A kanyarokban a versenyzői megfizették az árát, mert nem látták az első kerekeket, hogy pontosan helyezzék őket.\",","       more: \"A szélcsatorna részletei\",","       params: {","         label: \"Az első sarok · felülről, kerékagy-magasságban\",","         cases: [","-  