lly, not specifically the Evo II. The \"spoiler beneath\" in the first source may refer to the lower rear spoiler, not the front, so it's ambiguous.\n- **Production:** Mercedes built 502 examples in 1990, just enough to satisfy the regulations for its touring car racer.\n\nFor the front lip detail, you'd need a dedicated technical reference such as a Mercedes-Benz Classic document or an Evo II parts/homologation specification. I didn't find one in this search.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"53b6c8ac-a38a-4a5f-84ce-9e51859f66f1","timestamp":"2026-11-25T22:53:51.540Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Mercedes 190 E 2.5-16 Evolution II rear wing adjustable flap front spoiler lip two positions manually adjusted","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WGSkJnGePBAe1tMfqG4Xvy","content":[{"title":"the mercedes 190e 25 16 evo iis bodykit art of speed","url":"https://www.evo.co.uk/features/202841/the-art-of-speed-the-great-performance-car-design-details/the-mercedes-190e-25-16-evo-iis-bodykit-art-of-speed"},{"title":"the mercedes 190e 25 16 evo iis bodykit art of speed","url":"https://www.evo.co.uk/mercedes/mercedes-190/18091/the-mercedes-190e-25-16-evo-iis-bodykit-art-of-speed"},{"title":"the mercedes 190e 25 16 evo iis bodykit evo art of speed","url":"https://www.evo.co.uk/features/18091/the-mercedes-190e-25-16-evo-iis-bodykit-evo-art-of-speed"},{"title":"Mercedes-Benz 190E Evo II – Earning its wings - Octane Magazine","url":"https://www.octane-magazine.com/articles/features/mercedes-benz-190e-evo-ii-earning-its-wings/"},{"title":"Mercedes 190E 2.5-16 Evolution II bodykit","url":"https://pressreader.com/india/evo-india/20160821/282059096411099"},{"title":"1990 Mercedes-Benz 190 E 2.5-16 Evolution II","url":"https://www.supercars.net/blog/?p=210920"},{"title":"1990 Mercedes-Benz 190 E 2.5-16 Evolution II","url":"https://www.supercars.net/blog/REDACTED/"},{"title":"Mercedes 190 E Evo II revisited: