{"parentUuid":"05cd0044-5699-4304-8254-ecd6fd3700fc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2b390f8b-876d-46b3-a6e2-c7ff5a0a4a3f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J43YY2YKSg28X9pF6FoBao","type":"tool_result","content":"      42:31 node tools/cfd/part.mjs w196-wheel solve exposed 16\n#!/bin/sh\n# Local 3-D corner runs, coarse grids first, then the fine grids and the larger-tunnel check.\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../../../..\" || exit 1\nexport THREADS=7\nfor job in \"w196-wheel enclosed 24\" \"w196-wheel exposed 24\" \"evo-arch fitted 24\" \"w196-wheel enclosed 16\" \"w196-wheel exposed 16\" \"evo-arch fitted 16\" \"w196-wheel exposed-big 24\"; do\n  set -- $job; echo \"=== $job $(date +%T)\"; node tools/cfd/part.mjs $1 solve $2 $3 | grep -E \"cells|window|Error\" || echo \"FAILED $job\"\ndone\necho \"=== done $(date +%T)\"\n1:// Front-corner solids for the local 3-D tunnels (tools/cfd/part.mjs: w196-wheel, evo-arch), half car with the mirror at\n8:// y = 665. \"enclosed\": the 1955 streamliner's body, 820 mm half-width behind x = 500, a rounded nose to x = 1380, underside\n10:// tyre (40 mm clear inside, 32 mm to the outer skin), open below the body. \"exposed\": the open-wheel car's body, a rounded\n11:// nose to x = 950 widening to 330 mm half-width, 150–750 mm high: the tyre stands in free air. Suspension arms left out.\n14:// carved round its front tyre (333 mm radius, 135 mm half-width at y = 675): every body cell inside 378 mm of the hub and\n20:export const W196 = { tyre: { r: 340, half: 75, y: 665 }, hub: 340 };\n21:export const EVO = { tyre: { r: 333, half: 135, y: 675 }, hub: 333 };\n31:  if (x >= pts[0][0]) return pts[0][1];\n32:  for (let n = 1; n < pts.length; n++) if (x >= pts[n][0]) { const [xa, za] = pts[n - 1], [xb, zb] = pts[n]; return zb + (za - zb) * (x - xb) / (xa - xb); }\n35:const tyre = ({ r, half, y }, hub) => (x, yy, z) => z > GAP && Math.abs(yy - y) <= half && x * x + (z - hub) ** 2 < r * r;\n37:// Streamliner: plan half-width, top and underside along x; rounded edges in cross-section.\n38:const STREAM_TOP = [[1380, 420], [1300, 540], [1100, 640], [900, 700], [600, 740], [-300, 760], [-700, 770]];\n39:function enclosed(x, y, z) {\n41:  const w = 820 * Math.sqrt(1 - t * t), bottom = x > 1250 ? 150 + 110 * (x - 1250) / 130 : 150;\n42:  let top = lerp(STREAM_TOP, x);\n49:  if (x * x + (z - W196.hub) ** 2 < (W196.tyre.r + 40) ** 2 && y > W196.tyre.y - W196.tyre.half - 40 && y < W196.tyre.y + W196.tyre.half + 32) return false;\n52:// Open-wheel body: a rounded box section (exponent 2.5) centred 450 mm up, growing from the nose.\n53:function exposed(x, y, z) {\n68:export function w196(mode, h, domain = DOMAIN[\"w196-wheel\"]) {\n69:  const L = lattice(domain, h), wheel = tyre(W196.tyre, W196.hub), body = mode === \"enclosed\" ? enclosed : exposed;\n78:    if (solid[c] && y > EVO.tyre.y - EVO.tyre.half - 45 && x * x + (z - EVO.hub) ** 2 < (EVO.tyre.r + 45) ** 2) solid[c] = 0;","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9a14a0f6-f675-449c-8f45-a82d2da6b3e5","timestamp":"2026-11-25T23:04:05.187Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"      42:31 node tools/cfd/part.mjs w196-wheel solve exposed 16\n#!/bin/sh\n# Local 3-D corner runs, coarse grids first, then the fine grids and the larger-tunnel check.\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../../../..\" || exit 1\nexport THREADS=7\nfor job in \"w196-wheel enclosed 24\" \"w196-wheel exposed 24\" \"evo-arch fitted 24\" \"w196-wheel enclosed 16\" \"w196-wheel exposed 16\" \"evo-arch fitted 16\" \"w196-wheel exposed-big 24\"; do\n  set -- $job; echo \"=== $job $(date +%T)\"; node tools/cfd/part.mjs $1 solve $2 $3 | grep -E \"cells|window|Error\" || echo \"FAILED $job\"\ndone\necho \"=== done $(date +%T)\"\n1:// Front-corner solids for the local 3-D tunnels (tools/cfd/part.mjs: w196-wheel, evo-arch), half car with the mirror at\n8:// y = 665. \"enclosed\": the 1955 streamliner's body, 820 mm half-width behind x = 500, a rounded nose to x = 1380, underside\n10:// tyre (40 mm