s.mjs `precomputed`, offline.spec, smoke.spec, lib/app/i18n/hu.js, viewer/story `project`.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Opened underside behind x=450 in the 2-D splitter:** NaN in every window (wake reaching the zero-gradient outlet). Reverted to the closed underside.\n   - **Splitter cp saturated:** the pressure level floats with blockage. Display switched to speed; the comparison uses `across`, which needs no reference.\n   - **Arch camera showed downstream to the left:** changed to the W196-style view.\n   - **Paths started outside the crop:** inCrop trimming added.\n   - **Unsourced tyre-size claim** (225/50 ZR 17): removed.\n   - **A Hungarian caveat was inadvertently altered** (\"egyenesre\"): restored to \"egyenesbe\".\n   - **The 5-window replacement hit splitterSolve's identical loop first:** the trial showed 3 windows. Fixed by putting `w < 3` back in splitterSolve and `CORNER.windows` in cornerSolve.\n   - **The `timeout` command isn't available in zsh:** ran without it.\n   - **Chrome served cached modules:** fixed with a hard reload (cmd+shift+r).\n   - **Review findings** (wrong splitter probes, over-claimed W196 widths, wing reversal wording, arch attribution): addressed per items 1–4.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - **Payload:** ~91 kB total (Evo 55,326 B) vs 236,084 B old.\n   - **Wing:** final; captures checked.\n   - **Splitter 5 mm windows** (closed section, 3 FT settle):\n     - in: across 0.441/0.394/0.353 (lower 0.72→0.855)\n     - forward: across 1.431/1.243/1.097 (lower −0.159→0.183)\n     - Not a load: display only.\n   - **New-protocol W196 24 mm:**\n     - Exposed wake: 0.552, 0.602, 0.613, 0.644, 0.644 (≈40 % of road speed; positive; creeping up).\n     - Beside, exposed: −0.125 … −0.118. Beside, enclosed: −0.152 → −0.089 (drifting).\n     - So the beside contrast crosses zero and will likely be unresolved.\n     - Exposed band 570–818 (display).\n   - **Old 16 mm enclosed band:** 826–858. Evo arch 24 (old 3 windows): shift 367/374/377.\